---
---
<section class="galeri-header">
	<div class="header-container">
		<nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
			<ol>
				<li><a href="/">Beranda</a></li>
				<li><span class="separator">/</span></li>
				<li>Dokumentasi</li>
				<li><span class="separator">/</span></li>
				<li aria-current="page">Galeri Konservasi & RTH</li>
			</ol>
		</nav>

		<div class="header-content" data-animate="fade-up">
			<div class="section-label">
				<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
					<path d="M11 20A7 7 0 0 1 9.8 6.1C15.5 5 17 4.48 19 2c1 2 2 4.18 2 8 0 5.5-4.78 10-10 10Z"/>
					<path d="M2 21c0-3 1.85-5.36 5.08-6C9.5 14.52 12 13 13 12"/>
				</svg>
				KONSERVASI & EKOSISTEM
			</div>
			
			<h1 class="main-title">
				Galeri Rekam Jejak Konservasi &<br>
				<span class="text-light">Transformasi Hijau</span>
			</h1>
			
			<p class="description">
				Dokumentasi komprehensif implementasi penataan kawasan seluas 130.976 m², pemeliharaan keanekaragaman hayati, dan fasilitas ramah lingkungan di BBPPMPV BMTI.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.galeri-header {
		padding: 10rem 0 6rem;
		background-image: url('/img/kandep4.jpg');
		background-size: cover;
		background-position: center;
		background-attachment: fixed;
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
	}
	.galeri-header::before {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		background: rgba(10, 46, 20, 0.85); /* var(--green-900) at 85% opacity */
		z-index: 1;
	}

	.header-container {
		max-width: var(--container-max);
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 0 var(--container-padding);
		position: relative;
		z-index: 2;
	}

	/* Breadcrumb */
	.breadcrumb {
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}
	
	.breadcrumb ol {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
	}

	.breadcrumb a {
		color: var(--green-300);
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: 500;
		transition: color 0.2s ease;
	}

	.breadcrumb a:hover {
		color: var(--white);
	}

	.breadcrumb .separator {
		margin: 0 0.5rem;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
	}

	.breadcrumb [aria-current="page"] {
		color: var(--white);
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	/* Header Content */
	.header-content {
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.section-label {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		background: var(--white);
		padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
		border-radius: 50px;
		color: var(--green-700);
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.05em;
		box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.1);
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.main-title {
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
		font-weight: 800;
		color: var(--white);
		line-height: 1.1;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
	}

	.text-light {
		color: var(--green-400);
	}

	.description {
		font-size: 1.15rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
		max-width: 700px;
	}

	/* Background Elements */
	.decorative-bg {
		position: absolute;
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		z-index: 1;
		pointer-events: none;
	}

	.circle {
		position: absolute;
		border-radius: 50%;
		filter: blur(80px);
		opacity: 0.4;
	}

	.circle-1 {
		width: 400px;
		height: 400px;
		background: var(--green-200);
		top: -100px;
		right: -100px;
	}

	.circle-2 {
		width: 300px;
		height: 300px;
		background: var(--green-100);
		bottom: 50px;
		left: -150px;
	}
</style>
